    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0252","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Quilla Castellanos talks about the shadow of a canvas that was never painted. The artist asked that the microphone face away from the painting, so as not to influence it.</Description>
